WEBVTT

NOTE Generated by HOOKLINE — positioned for vertical safe area.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.673 line:82% align:center
Everybody tells you
the algorithm decides

00:00:02.673 --> 00:00:03.607 line:82% align:center
who wins.

00:00:03.607 --> 00:00:06.436 line:82% align:center
I spent four years
believing that,

00:00:06.436 --> 00:00:09.382 line:82% align:center
and it cost me about
eleven thousand

00:00:09.382 --> 00:00:11.940 line:82% align:center
hours of work I
would like back.

00:00:13.216 --> 00:00:15.007 line:82% align:center
Here is what
actually happened.

00:00:15.456 --> 00:00:18.508 line:82% align:center
In 2021 I was
posting five times a

00:00:18.508 --> 00:00:19.156 line:82% align:center
week.

00:00:19.156 --> 00:00:22.133 line:82% align:center
Every video was
better than the

00:00:22.133 --> 00:00:25.156 line:82% align:center
last one by any
measure I could

00:00:25.156 --> 00:00:25.614 line:82% align:center
name.

00:00:25.614 --> 00:00:27.536 line:82% align:center
Better lighting,
better audio,

00:00:27.536 --> 00:00:28.382 line:82% align:center
tighter edit.

00:00:28.708 --> 00:00:31.180 line:82% align:center
And the channel
did not move.

00:00:31.451 --> 00:00:33.879 line:82% align:center
Eight hundred
subscribers in January,

00:00:33.879 --> 00:00:36.156 line:82% align:center
nine hundred and
twelve in December.

00:00:37.443 --> 00:00:39.575 line:82% align:center
So I did what
everyone does.

00:00:39.874 --> 00:00:41.639 line:82% align:center
I blamed
the distribution.

00:00:41.950 --> 00:00:44.370 line:82% align:center
I read every thread
about watch time and

00:00:44.370 --> 00:00:46.775 line:82% align:center
session duration and
click-through rate.

00:00:46.775 --> 00:00:48.260 line:82% align:center
I bought two courses.

00:00:48.697 --> 00:00:51.596 line:82% align:center
I rewrote my titles
about forty times.
